; NextDAAD colour cycle fixture (GFX 9, 10, 11, 12). STIMULUS fixture:
; tests\build-tests.ps1 asserts the compiled bytes; tests\cycle_dump.py
; drives it over ZRCP and reads the DEBUG snapshot after every ANYKEY.
; 001.NX2 is the 16 x 16 palette card tests\art\mkpalcard.py generates:
; swatch n is index n on the identity palette, so a cycled row marches.
; Flag 200 is the phase: S10 ends in RESTART, which re-runs process 0
; from the top, and the second entry picks the script up from S11.
; The text window sits BELOW the card (rows 16-31): the card covers
; tilemap rows 0-15, and a hidden prompt would cost extra keys.
; The storm (S13, /PRO 3-6) prints its X cells with MES, not MESSAGE:
; MES has no trailing newline, so all 48 cells land on one row.

/CTL
_
/VOC
VID    50  verb
XBN    51  verb
SPR    52  verb
FADE   53  verb
CYC    54  verb
STOPC  55  verb
LOOK   4  verb
/STX
/0  "It's too dark to see anything."
/1  "I can also see:"
/2  "What now?"
/3  "What next?"
/4  "What should I do now?"
/5  "What should I do next?"
/6  "I didn't understand."
/7  "I can't go in that direction."
/8  "I can't do that."
/9  "I have with me:"
/10 "I am wearing:"
/11 " "
/12 "Are you sure?"
/13 "Another go?"
/14 " "
/15 "OK."
/16 "Press any key."
/17 " "
/18 " "
/19 " "
/20 " "
/21 " "
/22 " "
/23 "I'm not wearing one of those."
/24 "I can't. My hands are full."
/25 "I already have the _."
/26 "There isn't one of those here."
/27 "I can't carry any more things."
/28 "I don't have one of those."
/29 "I'm already wearing the _."
/30 "Y"
/31 "N"
/32 "More..."
/33 ">"
/34 " "
/35 " "
/36 "I now have the _."
/37 "I'm now wearing the _."
/38 "I've removed the _."
/39 "I've dropped the _."
/40 "I can't wear the _."
/41 "I can't remove the _."
/42 "I can't remove the _. My hands are full."
/43 "The _ weighs too much for me."
/44 "The _ is in the"
/45 "The _ isn't in the"
/46 ", "
/47 " and "
/48 ".#n"
/49 "I don't have the _."
/50 "I'm not wearing the _."
/51 "."
/52 "There isn't one of those in the"
/53 "Nothing."
/54 " "
/55 " "
/56 " "
/57 "I/O Error"
/58 " "
/59 "File name error."
/60 "Type in name of file."
/MTX
/0 "S1 cycling 16-31 every 10 frames#n"
/1 "S2 stopped#n"
/2 "S3 refused: frames 0#n"
/3 "S4 refused: last not above first#n"
/4 "S5 refused: flag 254#n"
/5 "S6 full range 0-255, last clamped to 254, one frame#n"
/6 "S7 stopped; entry 40 set red#n"
/7 "S8 entry 41 set to the transparent colour, dodged#n"
/8 "S9 buffered set of entry 42, revealed#n"
/9 "S10 cycling again, then RESTART#n"
/10 "S11 after RESTART#n"
/11 "S12 after RAMSAVE + RAMLOAD 255#n"
/12 "S13 storm under a cycle#n"
/13 "S14 stopped#n"
/14 "entry "
/15 " = "
/16 " "
/17 "#n"
/18 "X"
/19 "S15 video, silicon only: clip, then the cycle resumes#n"
/20 "verbs: VID XBN SPR FADE CYC STOPC#n"
/21 "S16 ticker armed - type VID#n"
/22 "the ticker runs from the interrupt hook and pauses for a clip"
/23 "S19 sprite set 2 started#n"
/24 "clip done#n"
/25 "S20 fade done#n"
/OTX
/0 "a thing"
/LTX
/0 "Colour cycle arena."
/CON
/0
